# Docker 场景：路径与 redis 主机见下。本机跑 ./start.sh 时脚本会 export 覆盖 REDIS 与 SAVE_DIR/LOG_DIR，勿与下方冲突。
# 优先级：环境变量 > 本文件 > 程序默认值。
# 与 config.example.ini 保持同一套键与说明；本文件为当前环境实际生效值。

[visionai]
# 与 docker-compose 中 VISIONAI_SECRET 一致；生产请修改
visionai_secret = 123456-bb6b-4889-a715-d9eb2d1925cc

# 检测（数值越小越常跑 YOLO+行为层；吸烟场景建议 5~8，稳定后再略加大）
detection_interval = 6
conf_threshold = 0.5

# 专模扩展（与 YOLO COCO 80 类并行；在「检测类型配置」中单独开关）
# face_detection.onnx / fall_detection.onnx / flame.pt / license_plate_detection.onnx
# make_call.onnx / mask.onnx / reflective_vest.pt / road_waterlogging.onnx
# safety_helmet.pt / sleeping.pt / smoking_detection.pt
face_model_path = /home/wjx/code/VisionAI/models/face_detection.onnx
fall_model_path = /home/wjx/code/VisionAI/models/fall_detection.onnx
flame_model_path = /home/wjx/code/VisionAI/models/flame.pt
license_plate_model_path = /home/wjx/code/VisionAI/models/license_plate_detection.onnx
make_call_model_path = /home/wjx/code/VisionAI/models/make_call.onnx
make_call_use_dedicated = true
make_call_require_person_overlap = false
mask_model_path = /home/wjx/code/VisionAI/models/mask.onnx
reflective_vest_model_path = /home/wjx/code/VisionAI/models/reflective_vest.pt
road_waterlogging_model_path = /home/wjx/code/VisionAI/models/road_waterlogging.onnx
safety_helmet_model_path = /home/wjx/code/VisionAI/models/safety_helmet.pt
sleeping_model_path = /home/wjx/code/VisionAI/models/sleeping.pt
# 睡觉误报多（低头看屏≈0.55）：提高专模置信与告警阈值，并加长持续时长
sleeping_model_conf = 0.55
sleeping_score_threshold = 0.70
sleeping_min_duration_sec = 4.0
dedicated_default_conf = 0.40
dedicated_default_score_threshold = 0.45
dedicated_default_min_duration_sec = 1.0

# 人员聚集（单帧检出人数 ≥ 阈值；与「人物」告警独立，开「人员聚集」即采集 person 框）
# gather_min_persons = 3
# 满足人数条件后需持续该秒数才告警（0 表示立即告警）
# gather_min_duration_sec = 3

# 吸烟：当前使用专训 YOLO 直连（单类 smoking）；yolo_direct=true 时不跑下方 ViT ONNX
smoking_yolo_direct = true
smoking_require_person_overlap = false
smoking_cigarette_detector_path = /home/wjx/code/VisionAI/models/smoking_detection.pt
smoking_cigarette_detector_conf = 0.30
smoking_cigarette_class_ids = 0
smoking_conf_threshold = 0.50
smoking_min_duration_sec = 1.5
smoking_log_scores = true
# 备用 ViT（yolo_direct=false 时生效）
smoking_model_path = /home/wjx/code/VisionAI/models/smoking_vit.onnx
smoking_preprocess = vit_hf
smoking_positive_class_index = 1

# 截图与模型
# 与卷映射一致：./snapshots -> /app/snapshots
save_dir = /app/snapshots
save_interval = 10
yolo_model = yolov8n.pt

# Ultralytics（主检测 / 通话·玩手机姿态共用）：不写或留注释 = 交给库自动选显卡；强制 CPU = cpu；单卡通常为 0
# yolo_device =

# 吸烟等行为 ONNX：`cpu`；`cuda_first` = CUDAExecutionProvider（含 GPU 轮子时）先于 CPU
onnx_provider = cpu

# 打电话 / 玩手机：YOLO+COCO 人机框重叠后再跑姿态；pose_model 用绝对路径可避免联网拉权重（Docker 内一般为 /app/models/yolov8n-pose.pt）
pose_model = /home/wjx/code/VisionAI/models/yolov8n-pose.pt
pose_for_phone_enabled = true
phone_pose_kp_min_conf = 0.28
phone_call_head_ratio = 0.26
phone_play_wrist_ratio = 0.20
phone_vertical_boundary = 0.42

# 与卷映射一致：./logs -> /app/logs
log_level = INFO
log_retention_days = 3
log_dir = /app/logs

# Compose 内访问 Redis 服务名与端口；宿主机 16379 为对外映射，容器内用 6379
redis_host = redis
redis_port = 6379
redis_password = VisionAI@2026
redis_db = 0
redis_key_prefix = visionai/

# 检测记录：Redis 中 Hash 的 TTL（天），并作为 MinIO/S3 截图生命周期的「天数 N」
detection_retention_days = 1

# 管理端历史等自动刷新（秒）
auto_refresh_interval = 20

# ---------- 对象存储（S3 兼容：自带 MinIO 或 云 S3 / 其它端点）----------
# 关闭上传：object_storage_enabled = false
object_storage_enabled = true
# 为 true 时是否仍保留本地截图（与 save_dir 同卷，便于排障/备份）
object_storage_keep_local = true
# 宿主机跑 VisionAI、MinIO 用 compose 映射 9000 时：用 127.0.0.1（勿用 minio 主机名，且需 NO_PROXY 见 start.sh）
# 若 VisionAI 也在 compose 同一网络内，可改为 http://minio:9000
s3_endpoint_url = http://127.0.0.1:9000
s3_access_key_id = minioadmin
s3_secret_access_key = minioadmin
s3_bucket = visionai
s3_region = us-east-1
# 与 MinIO 内网 HTTP 一致；公网 HTTPS 时改为 true
s3_use_ssl = false
# 对象键前缀，截图在 …/snapshots/…，后续可扩展 videos 等
s3_path_prefix = visionai/
s3_addressing_style = path
# 为 visionai/…/snapshots/ 写桶生命周期，过期天数= detection_retention_days；关闭则不在应用内写规则
s3_lifecycle_enabled = true

smtp_alert_enabled = true
smtp_host = smtp.qq.com
smtp_port = 465
smtp_use_ssl = true
smtp_use_tls = false
smtp_user = 2533479886@qq.com
smtp_password = uzuaawrqnskveafa
smtp_from = 2533479886@qq.com